Hi Claire,

There is an RW_llFunction_block sampler.

But can you say more about what you are trying to do?  This feature is intended for a case when your RllFun is not something that can be calculated in the model itself, so RW_llFunction is a relatively unusual need.  If you just have a vector of regression coefficients in a model, you shouldn't need to go this route.

-Perry

